{"jarnathan:To the organiser: Wednesday at eleven in Room 2 works for me. Please confirm my booking. To my friend: The room is being repaired, so our workshop is now on Wednesday at eleven in Room 2. Does that work for you?":"a3de91b40530299ea9a263f1b5318e5130d4962fd994d79a13af577547dbc6fc","lauren:The shop opens at eight thirty in the morning.":"f207c785ce6b4dbb6722b71da7af2768a51310486bdaa5dd7485ad00d329ca06","lauren:Had the stakeholders been consulted earlier, the strategy would have aligned better with market expectations.":"92a6561477c4659dd4daa21bd6f90cd90e7055730c206c425a61f6efe1fe03c7","lauren:He read the whole book.":"fc69af1a5307db03d811f0b691fc1d2b68a1dac892f99b3f81bb68dbc3685d0b","lauren:We cannot judge whether the policy works until we understand the unusual results.":"e8d1fa5d194d52270140f2a7e582dc2a60645fe4008537a9641cca4d3cffeab3","lauren:The DevOps pipeline now auto-scales during peak traffic, eliminating the need for manual intervention.":"3d2c226c1300dfb86462b92c146ca9f169bd8ae7bd4b12d7659e8faa22d63f3f","lauren:I forgot to call you yesterday.":"e50898e4792668d9c54c1b2063c94427182cd587a23a3096acd6d3fc78615b2b","lauren:We must submit the final report by Friday.":"b69afb18c4f6df68333ea566b60584ec4f8b31581e2ebaea91a23f361657208a"}